      "- Import those outcomes back into Google Ads as offline conversions, ideally with a value attached.",
      "- Set up Consent Mode and enhanced conversions correctly, so measurement stays accurate and within UK privacy rules.",
      "Once outcomes flow back, you can bid for the searches that bring in instructed clients rather than the ones that just generate form fills. That is the point at which Google Ads starts to compound.",
      "### Answer fast or lose the click",
      "Even a well-built campaign fails if enquiries wait. People with a legal problem often contact several firms at once. If an ad brings in a call at seven in the evening and nobody answers until the morning, that click has probably been wasted.",
