      "- Missed calls: lunchtimes, busy mornings and out-of-hours calls go unanswered or to voicemail, and many callers never leave a message.",
      "- Repetitive questions: opening hours, prices, parking, what to bring, whether you handle a particular kind of matter.",
      "- Slow qualification: skilled staff spend time on enquiries that were never a good fit.",
      "- Diary admin: booking, rescheduling and reminders take up a large share of reception time.",
      "Each of these costs you either clients or staff hours. An AI receptionist addresses them by being available on every channel, at any hour, with consistent answers.",
