      "- Book a consultation with the right fee earner, or pass urgent matters straight to an on-call solicitor.",
      "- Create the enquiry in your case management system with a summary, ready for conflict checks.",
      "It must not give legal advice. You set the boundaries: it can explain what you do and how you work, but questions about the person's own case go to a qualified person. We have built intake automation for a UK law firm along these lines, and the principle holds everywhere: the system gathers and routes, and solicitors advise.",
      "## How it works for clinics and healthcare practices",
