      "- Answer common questions about treatments, prices, preparation and aftercare from approved information.",
      "- Send confirmations and reminders, and offer slots freed by cancellations to people on a waiting list.",
      "- Recognise anything that sounds clinical or urgent and hand it straight to a person, with clear guidance to call 999 or NHS 111 where appropriate.",
      "Health information is special category data under UK GDPR, so the setup needs extra care: a lawful basis and an additional condition for processing, a data protection impact assessment, clear disclosure that the patient is speaking to an automated assistant, and suppliers who store data securely, ideally in the UK.",
      "## How it works for estate agents",
      "Estate agents juggle valuations, viewings, applicants and landlords, often with calls spread across evenings and weekends. An AI receptionist can:",
      "- Answer property enquiries from portals, your website and the phone, using up-to-date listing details.",
