      "- Disclosure: tell people they are speaking to an AI assistant, and give them an easy route to a human.",
      "- Data: check where calls and transcripts are stored, for how long and who can access them. Sign a data processing agreement with every supplier.",
      "- Voice and tone: make sure it sounds like your business, with the right level of warmth and formality for your clients.",
      "- Testing: run real scenarios, including awkward and emotional ones, before switching it on. Then listen to a sample of calls every week.",
