    title: "Speed to Lead: What Slow Replies Really Cost a Service Business",
    excerpt: "Every hour an enquiry waits, it cools. How to measure your speed to lead, find where replies stall and fix it without hiring.",
    author: "SIX³ Team",
    date: "2026-11-10",
