    title: "The Complete Guide to Voice Cloning for Business Marketing",
    excerpt: "How UK businesses can use voice cloning for ads, videos and translations, and the consent, quality and brand rules to put in place first.",
    author: "SIX³ Team",
    date: "2025-11-22",
